igger to reveal pop-up"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Dialog Boxes",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/dialog-boxes"}]},moduleList:{descriptions:["Add a hyperlinked list of course modules","Allow students to view and navigate module contents on any page","Provide a course overview and student progress on a page"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Module Lists",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/module-lists"}]},navigation:{descriptions:["Provide a variety of navigation options to students"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Navigation",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/navigation"}]},objective:{descriptions:["Insert prewritten program or course objectives, competencies, or other standards","Show the alignment of course contents with intended outcomes to students, accreditation agencies, and other stakeholders","Write new objectives based on Bloom's Taxonomy verbs","Share saved objectives with other users"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Objectives",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/objectives"}]},orderItems:{descriptions:["Create a list of items that can be ordered by students","Provide a way for students to order items in a list","Check student answers against the original order of items"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Order Items",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/order-items"}]},policy:{descriptions:["Insert content that stays up-to-date with a master copy","Add policies that can be maintained and updated by the institution"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Policies",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/policies"}]},popover:{descriptions:["Add pop-up info bubbles that appear when a viewer activates the text trigger with a click, tap, or enter key"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Popovers",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/popovers"}]},previewContent:{descriptions:["Preview page content as it would appear in different screen sizes","Ensure content is optimized for students using the mobile app"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Preview Content",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/preview-content"}]},progressIndicator:{descriptions:["Add an indicator bar that shows the user's position within a module","Provide students with enhanced intramodule navigation"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Progress Indicators",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/progress-indicators"}]},questions:{descriptions:["Add pre-built question stems to content","Share saved questions with other users"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Questions",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/questions"}]},quickCheck:{descriptions:["Add an ungraded quiz question to a page to check comprehension","Integrate informal self-assessment with instant feedback for students"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Quick Checks",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/quick-checks"}]},quote:{descriptions:["Add a styled quote to a page"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Quote",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/quote"}]},readability:{descriptions:["Get a readability score and grade level for the content","Convert page content to a different readability grade level","<strong>New Dale Chall</strong> - focuses on word familiarity (using a list of 3,000 common words) and sentence length","<strong>Flesch Kincaid</strong> - focuses on average syllable count per word and average sentence length","<strong>SMOG</strong> - focuses on sentence length and polysyllabic word count"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Readability",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/readability"}]},readTime:{descriptions:["Provide an estimated read time for page content in minutes based on words per minute (wpm) speed","Insert manual read time estimate"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Read Time",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/read-time"}]},release_note:{descriptions:["View monthly release notes and product updates for DesignPLUS"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Viewing Release Notes",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/viewing-release-notes"}]},selectAll:{descriptions:["Add an ungraded multiple answer activity to a page to check comprehension","Integrate informal self-assessment with instant feedback for students"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Select All",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/select-all"}]},settings:{descriptions:["Adjust personal user settings for DesignPLUS"],links:[{text:"User Guide: User Settings",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/user-settings"}]},shortcuts:{descriptions:["Add shortcut buttons for commonly used course functions"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Content Shortcuts",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/content-shortcuts"}]},snippet:{descriptions:["Add preconfigured chunks of HTML to content","Share saved HTML code with other users"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Snippets",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/snippets"}]},studentInteractiveSort:{descriptions:["Add an ungraded sorting activity to a page to check comprehension","Integrate informal self-assessment with instant feedback for students"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Sort Items",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/sort-items"}]},styleEditor:{descriptions:["Build and save custom styles for content elements","Adjust existing custom styles"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Style Editor",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/style-editor"}]},styleIframes:{descriptions:["Review and style all the iframe elements on the page in one place"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Style Iframes",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/style-iframes"}]},styleStudio:{descriptions:["Apply saved custom styles","Share saved styles with other users","Remove, rename, or edit saved styles"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Quick Style Manager",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/style-studio"}]},syllabus_nav:{descriptions:["Create a fixed menu on the right side of the page","Build a menu of links to page headings, items from a single module, or all items from all modules","Allow users to quickly navigate the contents of the page, module, or course regardless of their scroll position"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Side Navigation",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/page-navigation"}]},table:{descriptions:["Build and style tables in content","Convert tables to columns"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Tables",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/tables"}]},tableChecker:{descriptions:["Check for table headers","Adjust table header direction"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Table Checker",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/table-checker"}]},tabs:{descriptions:["Create a tab widget in which one panel can open at a time","Style tabs in content","Create quick references like FAQ or resources"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Accordions, Expanders, and Tabs",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/accordions-expanders-and-tabs"}]},templateContent:{descriptions:["Add page templates to content from a variety of sources","Add tutorial templates or user guide templates to content"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Template Content",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/template-content"}]},text:{descriptions:["Add highlight styles to selected text","Emphasize important content in line for students"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Text Highlights",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/text-highlights"}]},themes:{descriptions:["Apply theme styling to pages","Manage the banner title, banner image, and navigation block elements"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Themes",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/themes"}]},tooltip:{descriptions:["Add a hover tooltip to a trigger word or phrase"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Tooltips",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/tooltips"}]},tutorial:{descriptions:["View and complete DesignPLUS tutorials in the context of the page"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Help and Tutorials",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/help-and-tutorials-overview"}]},upgrade:{descriptions:["Update legacy DesignPLUS classes","Make page elements compatible with the new DesignPLUS Sidebar"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Upgrade",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/upgrade"},{text:"User Guide: Course Upgrade",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/course-upgrade"}]},userDetails:{descriptions:["Add and style user details blocks for teachers, TAs, and course designers","Quickly add contact information for students to reference"],links:[{text:"User Guide: User Details",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/user-details"}]},user_guides:{descriptions:["View DesignPLUS user guides for each tool"],links:[{text:"User Guide",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630"}]},videos:{descriptions:["Watch Cidi Labs training videos for DesignPLUS"],links:[{text:"Cidi Labs Video Hub",isExternal:!0,url:"https://videos.cidilabs.com/"}]},uxListHeading:{descriptions:["Review page usability issues related to design, file access, and screen size"],links:[{text:"User Guide: Usability Tools",isExternal:!0,url:"https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/accessibility-and-usability-overview"}],page:!0}},footer:{intro:{find:"<p>You can view the new user intro video later in the Help/Tutorials section.</p>",new:'<p>New to Next Generation DesignPLUS? Watch the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M_lhbq2AUgI" class="newUserIntroLink" target="_blank">New User Intro video</a> for a tour of the interface!</p>',wttitle:"Begin Walkthrough"},dismiss:{temp:"Dismiss",perm:"Don't show this message again"}},content_block:{arrange:"Arrange Content Blocks",alt_bg_colors_title:"Alternate content blocks background color",title:"Content Block",placeholderHeading:"Content Block Heading",placeholderContent:"Content",searchTitle:"Search Template Blocks",searchPlaceholder:"Search Blocks",removeEmptyTitle:"Remove Empty Elements",unwrapTitle:"Unwrap Content Block",addAboveTitle:"Add New Content Block Above",addBelowTitle:"Add New Content Block Below",headingTextTitle:"Heading Text",iconPickerLabel:"&nbsp; Icon Picker",blockHeading:"Block Heading",templateBehavior:"Template Behavior",reusableSR:"not reusable",reusableTitle:"This block contains an ID; it is not reusable",notReusable:"(Not Reusable)",primaryBlock:"Primary Block",extendedBlock:"Extended Block",sharedBlock:"Shared Block",courseBlock:"Course Block",cidilabsBlock:"Cidi Labs Block",lockedForEditing:"Locked for Editing",popupGallery:"Set images in this block as popup image gallery",popupDisableLink:"This Content Block contains an image inside a link",popupDisableImage:"This Content Block contains a popup image",advancedTitle:"Content Block Title",advancedCategory:"Content Block Category",advancedPanelNotice:"Advanced Panel is for [Content Blocks] customization pages only.",overwrite:"Overwrite",addAbove:"Add Above",addBelow:"Add Below",course:"This Course",shared:"Shared",extended:"Extended",primary:"Primary",cidilabs:"Cidi Labs",styleStudio:"Content Blocks Style Studio",noHeading:"No Heading",heading2:"Heading 2",heading3:"Heading 3",heading4:"Heading 4",heading5:"Heading 5",heading6:"Heading 6",walkthrough_1_title:"Content Block Walkthrough",walkthrough_1_intro:"You can use content blocks to group page elements into sections of content, quickly create page layout from block templates, and organize pages into manageable pieces to increase usability for students. ",walkthrough_2_title:"Add Block Buttons",walkthrough_2_intro:"You can use these buttons if you'd like to add new content blocks before or after the current content block.",walkthrough_3_title:"Arrange Content Blocks",walkthrough_3_intro:"Want to change the order of your content blocks?  This button is a shortcut to the Arrange Content tool.",walkthrough_4_title:"Unwrap Content Block",walkthrough_4_intro:"If you want to get rid of a content block but save the content inside, you can remove the content block container and convert the inner contents into regular text blocks.",walkthrough_5_title:"Remove Empty Elements",walkthrough_5_intro:"Got empty elements like paragraphs, list items, or links?  This button will quickly remove them all for you.",walkthrough_6_title:"Block Heading",walkthrough_6_intro:"This is where you can insert a title for the content block heading.",walkthrough_7_title:"Heading Levels",walkthrough_7_intro:"This is where you can choose the h2-h6 heading level for the content block heading.  And the circle-with-slash option removes the heading.",walkthrough_8_title:"Template Behavior",walkthrough_8_intro:"Select the default behavior for new template blocks: Overwrite the current block, add above the current block, or add below the current block.",walkthrough_9_title:"Filters",walkthrough_9_intro:"You can filter the available blocks by search term or by source.  Unchecking a source button removes any content blocks from that source.",walkthrough_10_title:"Template Blocks Panels",walkthrough_10_intro:"In these expanders, you can access any pre-designed templates for content blocks.",walkthrough_11_title:"Alternate Content Block Background Colors",walkthrough_11_intro:"In the Style panel, you can choose to alternate the background color of your content blocks, applying a light blue-gray background to every other content block. Check the <strong>Alternate content blocks background color</strong> checkbox to apply this style.",walkthrough_12_title:"Create Popup Image Gallery",walkthrough_12_intro:"You can also choose to create a popup image gallery on the saved page. Checking the <strong>Set images in this block as popup image gallery</strong> checkbox creates a carousel of enlarged images that users can scroll through sequentially.",walkthrough_13_title:"Content Block Title & Category",walkthrough_13_intro:"When using this tool on a [Content Blocks] customizations page, this Advanced section allows you to set or adjust the title and category of the block when it appears in the Content Block tool.",walkthrough_14_title:"Content Block Walkthrough Complete",walkthrough_14_intro:'This completes the Content Block tool walkthrough. For more information about the Content Block tool, visit the <a href="https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/content-blocks" target="_blank">Content Blocks tool User Guide article.</a> Happy course building!'}},p={sidebar:{title:"Diseno Grande",open_toolbox:"Abre"},help:{"tutorials.description":"Necesitamos ayuda. Ayudame!"}};function h(e,t){var n=Object.keys(e);if(Object.getOwnPropertySymbols){var a=Object.getOwnPropertySymbols(e);t&&(a=a.filter((function(t){return Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(e,t).enumerable}))),n.push.apply(n,a)}return n}function f(e){for(var t=1;t<arguments.length;t++){var n=null!=arguments[t]?arguments[t]:{};t%2?h(Object(n),!0).forEach((function(t){var a,i,s,o;a=e,i=t,s=n[t],(i="symbol"==typeof(o=function(e,t){if("object"!=typeof e||!e)return e;var n=e[Symbol.toPrimitive];if(void 0!==n){var a=n.call(e,"string");if("object"!=typeof a)return a;throw new TypeError("@@toPrimitive must return a primitive value.")}return String(e)}(i))?o:String(o))in a?Object.defineProperty(a,i,{value:s,enumerable:!0,configurable:!0,writable:!0