p>\n            <a target="_blank" href="https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/7037/pages/account-settings-instructions#dpPanel1" class="card-link">Learn more about customizations content identifiers</a>',type:"textarea",default:""},{id:"extendedDisplayName",title:"Extended Content Identifier",label:"Set Extended Customizations content label",description:'<p class="card-text">When set, this label appears on source panels and tool titles that refer to the Extended Customizations course.</p>\n            <a target="_blank" href="https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/7037/pages/account-settings-instructions#dpPanel1" class="card-link">Learn more about customizations content identifiers</a>',type:"textarea",default:""},{id:"accountSettingsAdminOnly",title:"Account Settings: Super Admin Access Only",label:"Only allow root admins to edit DesignPLUS account settings",description:'<p class="card-text">When set, only users with root admin roles can edit Account Settings with this tool.</p>\n            <a target="_blank" href="https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/7037/pages/account-settings-instructions#dpPanel4" class="card-link">Learn more about limiting Account Settings access</a>',type:"checkbox",default:!1},{id:"hideButton",title:"Access: Hide Launch Button",label:"Hide Launch Button by Default",description:'<p class="card-text">Only users who know the <span class="badge">Alt/Option+Shift+D</span> or <span class="badge">Ctrl+1</span> keyboard shortcut keys will be able to use the DesignPLUS Sidebar.</p>\n            <a target="_blank" href="https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/7037/pages/account-settings-instructions#hideLaunch" class="card-link">Learn more about hiding the launch button</a>',type:"checkbox",default:!1},{id:"toolGroup",title:"Account Tools Group",label:"Tools to display in account tools group",description:'<p class="card-text">Selected tools will appear in their own category in the <strong>Add</strong> panel of the sidebar to highlight account favorite tools.</p>\n            <a target="_blank" href="https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/7037/pages/account-settings-instructions#accountToolsGroup" class="card-link">Learn more about the account tools group</a>',type:"tool_list",default:[]},{id:"excludedModules",title:"Disabled Tools",label:"Disabled Tools",description:'<p class="card-text">Selected tools will be removed from the <strong>Add</strong> panel of the sidebar and will not be available to users.</p>\n            <a target="_blank" href="https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/7037/pages/account-settings-instructions#disableTools" class="card-link">Learn more about disabling tools</a>',type:"tool_list",default:[]},{id:"defaultTheme",title:"Default Theme",label:"Default Theme",description:'<p class="card-text">The selected theme will be automatically applied when a user initially adds a theme to the page with the sidebar.</p>\n            <a target="_blank" href="https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/7037/pages/account-settings-instructions#setDefaultTheme" class="card-link">Learn more about using Themes</a>',type:"theme_list",default:[]},{id:"brandOnly",title:"Branding Colors Only",label:"Branding Colors Only",description:'<p class="card-text">Only the branding color options will display in color pickers for basic tools.</p>\n            <a target="_blank" href="https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/7037/pages/account-settings-instructions#hideMiscSwatches" class="card-link">Learn more about default color swatches</a>',type:"checkbox",default:!1},{id:"sortableRubrics",title:"Sortable Rubrics",label:"Enable Sortable Rubrics",description:'<p class="card-text">Allow rubric editors to reorder rubric criteria.</p>\n            <a target="_blank" href="https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/7037/pages/account-settings-instructions#sortableRubrics" class="card-link">Learn more about sortable rubrics</a>',type:"checkbox",default:!1},{id:"studentCards",title:"Student Cards",label:"Enable Student Cards",description:'<p class="card-text">Provide an alternative view of the People page in each Canvas course that enlarges the student images.</p>\n            <a target="_blank" href="https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/7037/pages/account-settings-instructions#studentCards" class="card-link">Learn more about student cards</a>',type:"checkbox",default:!1},{id:"allyRelocate",title:"Ally Dropdown Relocation",label:"Relocate Ally alternate formats dropdown",description:'<p class="card-text">For institutions who use Blackboard Ally, if checked, this setting will move the Ally alternate formats dropdown from the content title to the top left corner of the content so that the native Canvas title can be hidden when a Banner Title is present.</p>\n            <a target="_blank" href="https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/7037/pages/account-settings-instructions#allyRelocate" class="card-link">Learn more about Ally dropdown relocation</a>',type:"checkbox",default:!1},{id:"hideImports",title:"Hide Imported Cidi Labs Customizations Content",label:"Prevent Cidi Labs customizations content from automatically importing in the Sidebar",description:'<p class="card-text">Cidi Labs creates and hosts customizations content such as content blocks that are automatically imported into the Sidebar.  Enabling this setting will prevent these customizations from being imported into the Sidebar tools for users working in the account/sub-account associated with this [Account Settings] page.</p>\n            <a target="_blank" href="https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/7037/pages/account-settings-instructions#cidilabsContent" class="card-link">Learn more about Cidi Labs customizations content</a>',type:"checkbox",default:!1},{id:"hideFonts",title:"Hide Font Style Options",label:"Do not allow font style options for users in the Sidebar",description:'<p class="card-text">Cidi Labs offers several imported Google Fonts for users to style text.  Enabling this setting will remove these font options from the Sidebar tools so that users working in the account/sub-account associated with this [Account Settings] page cannot change font styles with DesignPLUS.</p>\n            <a target="_blank" href="https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/7037/pages/account-settings-instructions#fontStyles" class="card-link">Learn more about limiting font styles</a>',type:"checkbox",default:!1},{id:"enableWizard",title:"Enable QuickStart Wizard",label:"Enable the QuickStart Wizard Button for all users",description:'<p class="card-text">Use the QuickStart Wizard button to quickly add DesignPLUS content to the editor.  Enabling this setting will make the QuickStart Wizard button available for users working in the account/sub-account associated with this [Account Settings] page, regardless of whether the sidebar launch button is hidden or not.</p>\n            <a target="_blank" href="https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/quickstart-wizard" class="card-link">Learn more about the DesignPLUS QuickStart Wizard</a>',type:"checkbox",default:!1},{id:"customizeWizardMessage",title:"Customize QuickStart Wizard Message",label:"Add a custom message to the QuickStart Wizard",description:'<p class="card-text">Customize the default message that appears in the QuickStart Wizard before any content has been added. To enable this setting, insert your desired HTML for the default message in the following text field. The HTML content will be appended to the end of the default startup message.</p>\n            <a target="_blank" href="https://cidilabs.instructure.com/courses/6630/pages/quickstart-wizard" class="card-link">Learn more about the DesignPLUS QuickStart Wizard</a>',type:"textarea",default:""},{id:"hideWizardImports",title:"Hide Imported Cidi Labs Resources in the QuickStart Wizard",label:"Prevent Cidi Labs templates and blocks from automatically importing in the QuickStart Wizard",description:'<p class="card-text">Cidi Labs creates and hosts template pages an